<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-GERMAN OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GERMAN OPEN SEMIFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG 1997-05-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Semifinal results in the German</p>
<p>Open men's tennis tournament on Saturday (Prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) beat 2-Yevgeny Kafelnikov (Russia)</p>
<p>6-3 6-1</p>
<p>10-Felix Mantilla (Spain) beat Tommy Haas (Germany 4-6 6-3 6-4</p>
</text>
